3 REM TYPE OUTPUT
4 REM STD 10.4.2 l.5621-5622, 12.1.2 prod. 15: an IMAGE line in the handler of an EXTERNAL SUB belongs to the unit.
100 DECLARE EXTERNAL SUB E
